 find the best place to start!\nNow let’s find the best place to start!\nStart from scratch\nTake the easiest lesson of the Spanish course\nFind my level\nLet Duo recommend where you should start learning\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":9,"selected_group":null,"visible_text":"It can be hard to stay motivated…\nIt can be hard to stay motivated…\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":10,"selected_group":null,"visible_text":"…so Duolingo is designed to be fun like a game!\n…so Duolingo is designed to be fun like a game!\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":11,"selected_group":null,"visible_text":"5\nNEW WORD\nWhich one of these is “cat”?\nagua\n1\ngato\n2\npapá\n3\nSKIP\nCHECK\nLOADING...\nMore Americans are learning a language on Duolingo than in the U.S. public school system."}],"preparation":[{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “cat”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “dog”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “water”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “milk”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"matching","prompt":"Select the matching pairs","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Select the correct meaning","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Select the correct meaning","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “mom”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “dad”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Select the correct meaning","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Select the correct meaning","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"matching","prompt":"Select the matching pairs","feedback":"positive"}],"ui_snapshot":""}
